            <ArticleTitle>[Postoperative analgesics consumption].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>40-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Prescription habits, dose and form of application of analgesics were investigated in a retrospective study of postoperative pain alleviation involving 250 patients. On the basis of clinical and pharmacological criteria, a prescription regime is presented for Paracetamol as used singly and in combination with Codeine. The prescription regime has been tested in a prospective study involving 50 patients and found to be effective.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
